# Portable vault data and local secrets must never be committed.
# `.mediavault/` is the current system directory, `.mediashelf/` the pre-rename
# one; a vault created inside the working copy would otherwise be committable.
.mediavault/
.mediashelf/
# Captured site logins and the fetch log (normally in ~/.mediavault, listed
# here so a stray copy next to the sources can never be added).
webnovel_sessions.json
webnovel_debug.log*
.env
*.local
*.secret
*.key
api_keys.toml

